        "note": "Uses Mathlib's explicit degree-two cocycles, coboundaries, quotient map and H2 vanishing API. Matrix, units, conjugation, additive type-tag, and ideal APIs are also reused from this pinned Mathlib dependency. Complete unmodified LowDegree, group-cohomology Basic, Rep.Basic and short-complex ModuleCat sources are included as reference text in docs/mathlib, with the upstream license and a SHA-256 manifest. docs/COHOMOLOGY_DEFINITIONS.md traces the definitions and their use by the obstruction. CI compares the copies with the pinned Git blobs. The complete project-specific construction and proof are included in Solution.lean; this repository is not a wrapper around another proof.",
